    author: 'Kalasam OEM Team',
    excerpt: 'OEM manufacturing in India allows international brands and distributors to access high-quality chemical manufacturing capacity at competitive costs. This guide covers how OEM partnerships work for camphor and specialty chemical products, what to look for in an OEM manufacturer, and how to structure the commercial relationship.',
